s: 10.\nTags: login, animated, webgl, threejs, input, validation, effect, security.\n## Overview\nRegistration Platform Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nConstruct your legacy, one foundation at a time. Join a collective of urban designers shaping tomorrow. Nova — Your portal to spatial excellence. Initialize Workspace Connect with visionaries and access premium architec…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Construct your legacy, one foundation at a time.; Initialize Workspace.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #191C21, secondary #050505, accent #191C21, background #191C21, surface #D0DFC2, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Registration - Platform</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <!-- GSAP for animations -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@200;300;400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        brand: {\n                            bg: '#94988E',      // Outer background\n                            formBg: '#050505',  // Dark form background\n                            inputBg: '#121212', // Input field background\n                            button: '#C3CEB5',  // Action button\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n    <style>\n        /* Minimal custom CSS to support GSAP masked text */\n        .mask-wrapper {\n            overflow: hidden;\n            display: inline-block;\n            vertical-align: top;\n        }\n        .mask-text {\n            display: inline-block;\n            transform: translateY(100%);\n            opacity: 0;\n            will-change: transform, opacity;\n        }\n        /* Custom scrollbar for webkit */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #333; border-radius: 4px; }\n\n        /* Subtle noise texture for premium feel */\n        .noise-bg::before {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            background-image: url(\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noiseFilter'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.65' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noiseFilter)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\");\n            opacity: 0.015;\n            mix-blend-mode: overlay;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 50;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-brand-bg min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-8 font-sans antialiased text-white selection:bg-brand-button selection:text-black\">\n\n    <!-- Main Container -->\n    <main id=\"app-card\" class=\"w-full max-w-[1200px] h-[85vh] min-h-[600px] max-h-[800px] bg-brand-formBg rounded-3xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)] relative z-10 noise-bg opacity-0 transform scale-95\">\n\n        <!-- Left Side: Image & Copy -->\n        <section class=\"relative w-full md:w-1/2 h-1/3 md:h-full overflow-hidden group\">\n            <!-- Parallax Image Container -->\n            <div id=\"hero-img\" class=\"absolute inset-[-5%] w-[110%] h-[110%] transition-transform duration-[2s] ease-out\">\n                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/6b97b0cc-6b81-4451-aacc-6b928e7d0a69_3840w.jpg\" alt=\"Modern Architecture\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center\">\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Gradients -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/90 via-black/30 to-transparent z-10 mix-blend-multiply\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#050505] via-transparent to-transparent z-10 opacity-80\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Content -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-16 flex flex-col items-center text-center z-20\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl lg:text-3xl tracking-tight font-light text-white/90 mb-3 split-text\">\n                    Construct your legacy, one foundation at a time.\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-white/60 font-light mb-6 split-text\">\n                    Join a collective of urban designers shaping tomorrow.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-white/40 font-light tracking-wide split-text\">\n                    Nova — Your portal to spatial excellence.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Right Side: Form -->\n        <section class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 h-2/3 md:h-full p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-16 lg:p-24 flex flex-col justify-center relative bg-brand-formBg z-20 overflow-y-auto\">\n\n            <div class=\"max-w-md w-full mx-auto flex flex-col h-full justify-center\">\n\n                <!-- Header -->\n                <div class=\"mb-10 form-element\">\n                    <h1 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-tight font-normal text-white/95 mb-3\">Initialize Workspace</h1>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-white/40 font-light leading-relaxed\">\n                        Connect with visionaries and access premium architectural blueprints tailored for your team.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Form -->\n                <form class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\">\n\n                    <!-- Input: Full Name (Active State Representation) -->\n                    <div class=\"form-element flex flex-col gap-1.5\">\n                        <label class=\"text-xs text-white/50 font-light ml-1\">Legal name *</label>\n                        <!-- Gradient Border Wrapper -->\n                        <div class=\"relative rounded-xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/20 via-white/5 to-transparent shadow-sm transition-all duration-300\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-button/20 to-transparent opacity-100 mix-blend-screen blur-sm\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"relative flex items-center bg-brand-formBg rounded-[10px] overflow-hidden px-4 py-3 group\">\n                                <input type=\"text\" value=\"Elena Rostova\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent text-sm text-white/90 font-light focus:outline-none placeholder-white/20\" placeholder=\"e.g. John Doe\">\n                                <!-- Simulated I-beam cursor icon for exact reference match -->\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:text-selection-linear\" class=\"text-white/30 text-lg ml-2 group-focus-within:text-brand-button transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Input: Email (Inactive State) -->\n                    <div class=\"form-element flex flex-col gap-1.5\">\n                        <label class=\"text-xs text-white/50 mt-4 font-light ml-1\">Work email *</label>\n                        <div class=\"relative rounded-xl p-[1px] bg-white/5 transition-all duration-300 focus-within:bg-gradient-to-br focus-within:from-white/20 focus-within:via-white/5 focus-within:to-transparent\">\n                            <div class=\"relative flex items-center bg-brand-inputBg rounded-[10px] overflow-hidden px-4 py-3\">\n                                <input type=\"email\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent text-sm text-white/90 font-light focus:outline-none placeholder-white/20\" placeholder=\"e.g. elena@studio.io\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Input Row: Passwords -->\n                    <div class=\"form-element flex mt-4 flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5 w-full\">\n                            <label class=\"text-xs text-white/50 font-light ml-1\">Access key</label>\n                            <div class=\"relative rounded-xl p-[1px] bg-white/5 transition-all duration-300 focus-within:bg-white/10\">\n                                <div class=\"relative flex items-center bg-brand-inputBg rounded-[10px] overflow-hidden px-4 py-3\">\n                                    <input type=\"password\" value=\"••••••••••••\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent text-sm text-white/90 font-light focus:outline-none tracking-widest placeholder-white/20\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:eye-closed-linear\" class=\"text-white/20 text-base cursor-pointer hover:text-white/50 transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5 w-full\">\n                            <label class=\"text-xs text-white/50 font-light ml-1\">Verify key</label>\n                            <div class=\"relative rounded-xl p-[1px] bg-white/5 transition-all duration-300 focus-within:bg-white/10\">\n                                <div class=\"relative flex items-center bg-brand-inputBg rounded-[10px] overflow-hidden px-4 py-3\">\n                                    <input type=\"password\" value=\"••••••••••••\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent text-sm text-white/90 font-light focus:outline-none tracking-widest placeholder-white/20\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:eye-closed-linear\" class=\"text-white/20 text-base cursor-pointer hover:text-white/50 transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <p class=\"form-element text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-white/30 font-light ml-1 -mt-1 mb-4 mt-8\">\n                        Key must be at least 12 characters, including a symbol and a numeral.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <!-- Submit Button -->\n                    <button type=\"button\" class=\"form-element w-full py-3.5 rounded-lg bg-brand-button text-black text-sm font-normal tracking-wide transition-transform active:scale-[0.98] hover:bg-[#d0dfc2] flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                        Launch Workspace\n                    </button>\n\n                    <!-- Footer Links -->\n                    <div class=\"form-element flex flex-col items-center gap-6 mt-6\">\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-white/40 font-light hover:text-white/80 transition-colors\">\n                            Already configured? <span class=\"text-white/70\">Authenticate</span>\n                        </a>\n\n                        <p class=\"text-[10px] text-white/30 font-light text-center max-w-[80%]\">\n                            By initializing, you accept our <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white/50 underline decoration-white/20 underline-offset-2 hover:text-white/80 transition-colors\">Terms of Service</a> and <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white/50 underline decoration-white/20 underline-offset-2 hover:text-white/80 transition-colors\">Privacy Protocol</a>.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // Wait for DOM\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // 1. Initial Page Load Animation for main card\n            gsap.to(\"#app-card\", {\n                opacity: 1,\n                scale: 1,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                ease: \"expo.out\",\n                delay: 0.1\n            });\n\n            // 2. Setup Masked Text Reveal for the left side\n            const splitTextElements = document.querySelectorAll('.split-text');\n\n            splitTextElements.forEach(element => {\n                // Simple word splitting for the effect\n                const words = element.innerText.split(' ');\n                element.innerHTML = ''; // Clear original text\n\n                words.forEach((word, index) => {\n                    const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                    wrapper.className = 'mask-wrapper';\n                    // Add space after word unless it's the last one\n                    const space = index < words.length - 1 ? '&nbsp;' : '';\n\n                    const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                    inner.className = 'mask-text';\n                    inner.innerHTML = word + space;\n\n                    wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                    element.appendChild(wrapper);\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Animate the masked text\n            gsap.to('.mask-text', {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1,\n                stagger: 0.04,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                delay: 0.5\n            });\n\n            // 3. Form Elements Staggered Fade In\n            gsap.fromTo('.form-element',\n                { y: 20, opacity: 0 },\n                {\n                    y: 0,\n                    opacity: 1,\n                    duration: 0.8,\n                    stagger: 0.1,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\",\n                    delay: 0.6\n                }\n            );\n\n            // 4. \"WebGL-like\" Parallax on mouse move over the image section\n            const imageSection = document.querySelector('section.group');\n            const heroImg = document.getElementById('hero-img');\n\n            if(window.matchMedia(\"(min-width: 768px)\").matches) {\n                imageSection.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                    const { left, top, width, height } = imageSection.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    const x = (e.clientX - left) / width - 0.5;\n                    const y = (e.clientY - top) / height - 0.5;\n\n                    gsap.to(heroImg, {\n                        x: x * -25, // Move opposite to mouse for parallax depth\n                        y: y * -25,\n                        rotationY: x * 5,\n                        rotationX: -y * 5,\n                        duration: 1,\n                        ease: \"power2.out\"\n                    });\n                });\n\n                imageSection.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                    gsap.to(heroImg, {\n                        x: 0,\n                        y: 0,\n                        rotationY: 0,\n                        rotationX: 0,\n                        duration: 1.5,\n                        ease: \"elastic.out(1, 0.5)\"\n                    });\n                });\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "registration-platform.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/registration-platform.jpg", "source_name": "registration-platform-DESIGN.md", "views": 183, "forks": 19, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T08:19:20.477786+00:00"}